      "body": "Adds QACUSD, the on-chain mirror of client balances held on the Quantum Algorithmic Capital ledger, deployed on Base at `0x6eC22DacDdcc202e2B41fC204795B4da72d6bf30` (source verified on Basescan). Native to Base, no L1 counterpart, `nobridge: true`. Minting is capped at 100,000,000 with a per-day ceiling; all roles are held by a 2-of-3 hardware-wallet Safe. Website: https://quantumalgorithmiccapital.com.",
